---
import data from '../../../data/templates/concierge.json';
---
<section id="contact" class="relative bg-concierge-nuit text-white py-24 md:py-32 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-25 pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 80% 20%, #B89758, transparent 60%);"></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-content mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <p class="font-inter text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.45em] text-concierge-laiton mb-4">§ On démarre ?</p>
      <h2 class="font-cormorant italic leading-[0.92] tracking-tight" style="font-size: clamp(56px, 9vw, 140px);">
        En trois<br/>questions.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-8 font-inter text-white/80 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
        L'audit est gratuit, sans engagement. On vous propose un revenu cible chiffré dans les sept jours.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-4 font-inter text-sm text-white/75">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-concierge-laiton"></span> {data.info.telephone}</p>
        <p class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-concierge-laiton"></span> {data.info.email}</p>
        <p class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-concierge-laiton"></span> {data.info.instagram}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white/[0.04] ring-1 ring-concierge-laiton/30 p-8 md:p-12" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();" novalidate>
      <fieldset class="space-y-4">
        <legend class="font-cormorant italic text-2xl text-concierge-laiton mb-3">1. De quel bien parle-t-on ?</legend>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          {['Studio / T1', 'T2 – T3', 'Villa 4+ chambres', 'Plusieurs biens'].map(t => (
            <label class="cursor-pointer">
              <input type="radio" name="type" value={t} class="peer sr-only"/>
              <span class="block px-4 py-3 ring-1 ring-white/20 peer-checked:ring-concierge-laiton peer-checked:bg-concierge-laiton/15 font-inter text-sm transition-colors">{t}</span>
            </label>
          ))}
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <hr class="my-8 border-concierge-laiton/15"/>

      <fieldset class="space-y-4">
        <legend class="font-cormorant italic text-2xl text-concierge-laiton mb-3">2. Combien de chambres ?</legend>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2">
          {['1','2','3','4','5+'].map(n => (
            <label class="cursor-pointer">
              <input type="radio" name="ch" value={n} class="peer sr-only"/>
              <span class="block text-center py-3 ring-1 ring-white/20 peer-checked:ring-concierge-laiton peer-checked:bg-concierge-laiton/15 font-cormorant italic text-lg">{n}</span>
            </label>
          ))}
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <hr class="my-8 border-concierge-laiton/15"/>

      <fieldset class="space-y-4">
        <legend class="font-cormorant italic text-2xl text-concierge-laiton mb-3">3. Disponibilités pour la visite</legend>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <label class="block">
            <span class="font-inter text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-concierge-laiton">Nom & email</span>
            <input type="text" class="mt-2 w-full h-12 px-4 bg-white/10 ring-1 ring-white/20 font-inter text-white" />
          </label>
          <label class="block">
            <span class="font-inter text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-concierge-laiton">Téléphone</span>
            <input type="tel" class="mt-2 w-full h-12 px-4 bg-white/10 ring-1 ring-white/20 font-inter text-white" />
          </label>
          <label class="block sm:col-span-2">
            <span class="font-inter text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-concierge-laiton">Créneaux possibles (texte libre)</span>
            <textarea rows="3" class="mt-2 w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white/10 ring-1 ring-white/20 font-inter text-white" placeholder="Ex. lundi après-midi, mercredi matin…"></textarea>
          </label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <button type="submit" class="mt-8 w-full h-14 bg-concierge-laiton text-concierge-nuit font-inter text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] hover:bg-white transition-colors">
        Demander mon audit gratuit
      </button>
      <p class="mt-3 text-center font-inter text-xs text-white/55 italic">Réponse sous 48h ouvrées. Démonstration — formulaire non fonctionnel.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
